 "DixonRelaxivity"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "3a74c872-53f1-b946-a2fc-5ed30c692218"],
 "\[LineSeparator]is an option for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["DixonReconstruct",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/DixonReconstruct"]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"12d3ebda-d0a5-9545-b946-c71bb9548fd6"],
 ". Defines the T2 relaxation times in ms of water and the fat peaks being \
used. Is only used if ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["DixonFixT2",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/DixonFixT2"]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"598580f6-480e-9e45-be7f-b06a2b3deb82"],
 " is set to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["True",
   BaseStyle->"Link"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "12140512-a603-0f4f-8fc5-21d3aab8b4d4"],
